flowchart LR
	ZERO["zero-width and format characters<br/>carrying no visible width"]
	JOIN["a zero-width joiner inside a file path"]
	RLM["a right-to-left mark inside a command"]
	SPOOF["the U+202E visual-spoofing override<br/>in what looks like plain text"]
	CHANGE["none showing up in the transcript<br/>all of them changing what a parser - shell<br/>or diff sees"]
	ZERO --> JOIN --> CHANGE
	ZERO --> RLM --> CHANGE
	ZERO --> SPOOF --> CHANGE
